
## Test Coverage

Unit tests for the audit module are in `tests/ingestion/test_audit.py`. They cover:

- Model serialization and defaults.
- Critical / warning / merge-candidate detection.
- Reading and parsing of storage artifacts.
- Missing/malformed file handling.
- Ensuring audit does not mutate the input snapshot.

## Static Smoke Script

`scripts/smoke_lightrag_audit_static.sh` runs the audit unit tests locally with no external services. It is intended for CI or local verification.

